y":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-11T14:38:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T00:14:18Z","closed_at":"2025-06-18T23:29:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107410","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107410.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107410.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-18T23:29:52Z"},"body":"Follow-up to #96921.\r\n\r\nOne of the known issues is updating CSV translations don't update preview text in the editor.\r\n\r\n## Fix updating CSV translation files not updating preview text in the editor\r\n\r\nUnlike `.po` files, importing a `.csv` file as translations does not \"import\" the file as any resource. The `.translation` files are extra files generated during the \"import as nothing\" process.\r\n\r\nA non-imported resource file is only reloaded if the file's last modified time change. I think this logic was only considering external changes to resource files since the editor hooks into the resource saving process, tracking the file's last modified time automatically. So the newly generated `.translation` files won't be reloaded as the file's last modified time is always up-to-date.\r\n\r\n~~Fortunately, `Resource` tracks its last modified time too. So we can compare the file's last modified time with the cached resource's last modified time.~~\r\n\r\nThis PR forces a reload of the resource caches corresponding to the generated files at the end of the import process.\r\n\r\n## Only update translation when necessary\r\n\r\nCurrently, `NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED` is propagated in the editing scene tree whenever project settings change. This is unnecessary and could make the stuttering worse if the editing scene is very complex.\r\n\r\nIn this PR, when project settings change, the notification is propagated only if the translation file set of the currently previewing locale is changed.\r\n\r\nIn order to compare `HashSet` equality, I added `operator{==,!=}` for it and related tests.\r\n\r\n## Simplify the preview toggle logic\r\n\r\nOriginally, the translation preview PR turns translation preview on/off by updating the editing scene root's auto translation mode. Later, this was changed to disabling the entire translation domain for identifier-based translation.\r\n\r\nThe change made changing auto translation mode unnecessary, but this fact was made less obvious by some optimization logic :(\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHere is a test project with a demo scene showing translatable texts from PO and CSV files: [test-4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20692874/test-4.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107410/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107410/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}